<!DOCTYPE html><html  lang="de"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Cybervorfall bei der RUAG MRO: VBS schliesst Prüfung ab und empfiehlt weitere Massnahmen</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/entry.Dc8Q8SqE.css" crossorigin><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/B8z2615z.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/83Dbi4rV.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Bp_mZuV4.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Cx6kv6E4.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/waV3Tfg4.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Bg41Sff1.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/BudwMkti.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/IYJACK4Z.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CrmC0BBu.js"><link rel="preload" as="fetch" fetchpriority="low" crossorigin="anonymous" href="/_nuxt/builds/meta/190d75ee-cd91-4f28-8ae4-92507ef64db0.json"><script type="module" src="/_nuxt/B8z2615z.js" crossorigin></script><link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon-16x16.png" data-hid="faviconSm"><link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon-32x32.png" data-hid="faviconMd"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" data-hid="appleTouchIcon"><meta name="robots" content="all"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"></head><body  class="body--internet"><div id="__nuxt"><div><header id="main-header"><a id="main-content-button" href="#main-content" tabindex="0" class="skip-to-content" type="button" aria-label="Zum Hauptinhalt springen">Zum Hauptinhalt springen</a><!----><div id="top-bar-container" class="top-bar"><div id="top-bar" class="top-bar__bar"><div class="container container--flex"><button id="top-bar-button" class=